    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Primary Effect</strong></p>\n<p>Dose lasts for 10 Minutes.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Induces a state of frenzy and increased aggression</li>\n  <li>User takes no Bonus Damage for any Critical Injury</li>\n  <li>Wound State/Facedown penalties to Skill or Stat checks are halved*</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Secondary Effect (DV17)</strong></p>\n<p>\n  When the dose wears off, the user rolls\n  <strong>WILL + Resist Torture/Drugs + 1d10 against Secondary DV</strong>.\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>-2 Humanity Loss.</li>\n  <li>\n    User is now addicted to Berserker if not already addicted. +1 to Base Death\n    Save Penalty while addicted.\n  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n  <em>*This is not supported by the system and must be manually adjusted.</em>\n</p>\n"
